    OpenCetRichExampleRow(
      exampleId: 'tatoeba:12267211:13906402',
      sourceId: 'tatoeba-cc-by-2.0-fr',
      englishText: 'Officials from government and industry are also starting to recognize the potential of the Methane Capture Project. The U.S. Department of Agriculture is funding experimental on-farm sites in Mississippi and several other states. Some large poultry processors are launching renewable energy divisions to power their feed mills. And a fuel company is investigating the possibility of pumping chicken-waste methane instead of natural gas through its pipeline, and to use it to power some of the generators along the way.',
      chineseText: '政府官員與業界人士也開始意識到「甲烷捕捉計畫」的潛力。美國農業部正在密西西比州及其他數個州資助農場內的實驗場址。部分大型禽肉加工業者正在成立再生能源部門，以供應飼料廠所需電力。此外，一家燃料公司正在評估是否可以用雞隻排放的甲烷取代天然氣，並注入管線，用來為部分沿線發電機提供動力。',
